    {
      "subId": "1900306",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Sister Victoria",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "190030601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "190030601": {
            "id": "190030601",
            "speakerId": 1471,
            "speakerName": "Victoria",
            "text": "Yes, my child?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190030602"
            ]
          },
          "190030602": {
            "id": "190030602",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "About Barbara's time off...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190030603"
            ]
          },
          "190030603": {
            "id": "190030603",
            "speakerId": 1471,
            "speakerName": "Victoria",
            "text": "Oh yes, Sister Barbara just submitted her request for half a day's leave. She said she had plans with a friend.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190030604"
            ]
          },
          "190030604": {
            "id": "190030604",
            "speakerId": 1471,
            "speakerName": "Victoria",
            "text": "I must say though, it is quite unusual for Barbara to request time off just to see a friend...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190030605"
            ]
          },
          "190030605": {
            "id": "190030605",
            "speakerId": 1471,
            "speakerName": "Victoria",
            "text": "But that's beside the point. What is it you'd like to ask me?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190030606"
            ]
          },
          "190030606": {
            "id": "190030606",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "About \"Fantastic Summer-Serendipity Coral Sparkling Tea\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190030607"
            ]
          },
          "190030607": {
            "id": "190030607",
            "speakerId": 1471,
            "speakerName": "Victoria",
            "text": "Oh? You mean to tell me that Barbara intends to accompany you to buy this... special drink?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190030608"
            ]
          },
          "190030608": {
            "id": "190030608",
            "speakerId": 1471,
            "speakerName": "Victoria",
            "text": "Then you must be the friend that she mentioned, I presume?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190030609"
            ]
          },
          "190030609": {
            "id": "190030609",
            "speakerId": 1471,
            "speakerName": "Victoria",
            "text": "Hmm, seeing as you're the Honorary Knight, I guess that's fine...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190030610"
            ]
          },
          "190030610": {
            "id": "190030610",
            "speakerId": 1471,
            "speakerName": "Victoria",
            "text": "Well then, please take good care of Sister Barbara.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190030611"
            ]
          },
          "190030611": {
            "id": "190030611",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Why does Barbara always have to report her plans?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190030612"
            ]
          },
          "190030612": {
            "id": "190030612",
            "speakerId": 1471,
            "speakerName": "Victoria",
            "text": "Well, as you may already know, Sister Barbara is quite popular in Mondstadt for several reasons...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190030613"
            ]
          },
          "190030613": {
            "id": "190030613",
            "speakerId": 1471,
            "speakerName": "Victoria",
            "text": "Although the citizens here may only be acting out of good intention, there are too many of them, and Sister Barbara can't handle it all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190030614"
            ]
          },
          "190030614": {
            "id": "190030614",
            "speakerId": 1471,
            "speakerName": "Victoria",
            "text": "If they appear while she is working here at the Church, we can come and intervene.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190030615"
            ]
          },
          "190030615": {
            "id": "190030615",
            "speakerId": 1471,
            "speakerName": "Victoria",
            "text": "But if she's approached by fans during her time off, then she can only fend for herself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190030616"
            ]
          },
          "190030616": {
            "id": "190030616",
            "speakerId": 1471,
            "speakerName": "Victoria",
            "text": "And not to mention, she's too... kind. She'll always try to fulfill the requests of the citizens of Mondstadt, even when it takes a heavy toll and leaves her more exhausted than actual working hours.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190030617"
            ]
          },
          "190030617": {
            "id": "190030617",
            "speakerId": 1471,
            "speakerName": "Victoria",
            "text": "So with that in mind, we thought we'd have Sister Barbara always tell us where she'd be, just in case we need to come rescue her from the crowds.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "190030618"
            ]
          },
          "190030618": {
            "id": "190030618",
            "speakerId": 1471,
            "speakerName": "Victoria",
            "text": "My hope is that Sister Barbara stops pushing herself so hard..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
